# Changelog

## [0.3.1.14]

### Added
- `artifact_dirs` option to `pipe config`.
- existing antab is used when available in `artifact_dirs` or `folder_for_fits`.

## [0.3.1.13]

### Fixed
- `--default` for `pipe config` now preserves the existing config.
- `snr_threshold_phref` was misspelled, corrected.

